{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23706","headline":"早朝 · 白居易","name":"早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼓动出新昌，鸡鸣赴建章。\n翩翩稳鞍马，楚楚健衣裳。\n宫漏传残夜，城阴送早凉。\n月堤槐露气，风烛桦烟香。\n双阙龙相对，千官雁一行。\n汉庭方尚少，慙叹鬓如霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}